Z||000000||FIERO JOHN-WI||11-01-2001||11:23 AM||||Thats right hot from the newsletter of Paul Duff himself who is in charge with (jerry) to lock in the location and date for the 2002 FOCOA NATIONALS well here it is:<BR>AUGUST 1,2,3,4 <BR>The Host Hotel  "INN at GRAND GLAIZE" in Osage Beach, Missouri<BR>and this is the best part rooms are only $69 per night (do you believe it for a FOCOA NATIONAL) you can make reservations now and they will give you the same room rate 5 days after the 4th of August if you would like to stay longer and you can cancel 72 hours prior to the event and not be charged, they have 153 rooms set aside you MUST TELL THEM YOU WANT THE FIERO CAR CLUB RATE. (PAUL DUFF SAID) the phone number is 1-800-348-4732 and I did some more looking into it so you could see how nice this place is they got a web site: <A HREF="http://www.innatgrandglaize.com" TARGET=_blank>www.innatgrandglaize.com</A>   so I hope to see you there and thank you to Paul & Jerry for picking out a great place.  Later Fiero John!<P>[This message has been edited by FIERO JOHN-WI (edited 11-01-2001).]<P>[This message has been edited by FIERO JOHN-WI (edited 11-01-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by FIERO JOHN-WI (edited 11-01-2001).]||||reg||1
