Z||000017||bHooper||11-01-2001||09:57 PM||||1009 miles too far from the front porch, so Galen <B>Won't</B> be attending.<P>therefore, i suggest we all caravan there!  there is nothing quite like the experience of an 18 hour trip in a fiero (4 hours to Williamsburgh about killed Melinda).  <P>speaking of which, my lovely mother and father-in-law have a little "resort" at the lake <A HREF="http://www.bayhillyunkers.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.bayhillyunkers.com/</A>   maybe i could pull off a group rate or something (when i say it's nothing fancy... i mean it).  i should have red car painted by then (and maybe an engine swap too!) so it could be a fun trip (although i will have to teach Melinda how to drive a fiero 9that gives me a 3rd project).<P>anyway, party cove is a blast (women seem to lose their tops!) and we can all hop on the pontoon boat and go out for a spin! <P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Red</B></FONT></FONT> 86 GT 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><B>Black</B></FONT> <u>86 SE Automatic</u>||||reg||1
